509
00:37:09,719 --> 00:37:10,760
and for this contest.

510
00:37:12,400 --> 00:37:13,719
I want you to win.

511
00:37:14,320 --> 00:37:15,559
It earns you exam points.

512
00:37:16,360 --> 00:37:17,039
Ma Na.

513
00:37:18,840 --> 00:37:20,440
Do you think I'm punishing you?

514
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:25,119
Sorry.

515
00:37:26,079 --> 00:37:26,960
I don't have the time

516
00:37:27,559 --> 00:37:28,400
or the interest.

517
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:31,599
Fine. I'll practice.

518
00:37:33,519 --> 00:37:34,679
But Yang Le has to stay too.

519
00:37:35,320 --> 00:37:35,840
Yang Le.

520
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:37,519
You're partners.

521
00:37:37,960 --> 00:37:39,039
Stay and practice with her.

522
00:37:41,159 --> 00:37:41,880
Yes, Mr. Zhou.

523
00:37:42,440 --> 00:37:42,920
All right.

524
00:37:44,119 --> 00:37:45,719
That's enough for today.

525
00:37:46,360 --> 00:37:47,320
The contest is coming up.

526
00:37:47,840 --> 00:37:48,639
Go home

527
00:37:48,719 --> 00:37:50,199
