528
00:37:51,519 --> 00:37:52,280
Good work, everyone.

529
00:37:52,840 --> 00:37:55,320
Thank you, Mr. Zhou.

530
00:37:55,519 --> 00:37:56,079
Dismissed.

531
00:37:57,639 --> 00:37:59,840
Seriously? Thirty times?

532
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:00,519
Jiang Ting.

533
00:38:02,159 --> 00:38:03,559
Can we talk later?

534
00:38:10,280 --> 00:38:10,920
Jiang Ting.

535
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:16,440
Yang Le.

536
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:18,079
I'm going to change.

537
00:38:18,159 --> 00:38:18,840
Wait for me.

538
00:38:25,720 --> 00:38:27,720
