540
00:38:47,159 --> 00:38:47,760
So?

541
00:38:48,280 --> 00:38:49,199
Was the haunted house fun?

542
00:39:16,360 --> 00:39:17,639
If you can't stand her,

543
00:39:18,119 --> 00:39:20,000
